# papers/ drop zone
#
# Place each accepted paper in its own subfolder:
#   Initial collection : papers/p<submission-id>/       (e.g., papers/p1992/)
#   After volume #     : papers/<vol><4-digit-page>/    (e.g., papers/164560001/)
#
# Expected contents per folder (for Springer submission):
#   - Camera-ready PDF (named paper.pdf locally for proceedings.tex assembly, or author PDF)
#   - All source files: .tex, .bib/.bbl, figure images (LaTeX) OR .docx (Word; no .docm)
#   - Signed LNCS Licence-to-Publish (LTP) form (wet signature)
#   - Optional Alt Text Excel file (if provided by authors)
#
# Git tracking notes (see root .gitignore):
#   IGNORED  : papers/**/*.pdf, papers/**/*.zip, LaTeX build artefacts (*.aux, *.log, etc.)
#              Add binary PDFs explicitly with `git add -f <file>` only if needed.
#   TRACKED  : *.tex, *.bib, *.bbl, figure images, *.docx (Springer source deliverables)
